# GitHub token used by /api/stats (katib + GitHub REST).
# Local dev: cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
# Production: npx wrangler secret put KATIB_GITHUB_TOKEN
# Classic PAT, no scopes needed for public data. Server-side only: never expose
# this to the browser and never pass it as a build argument.
# Get one at https://github.com/settings/tokens
KATIB_GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your_token_here
